OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested after girl, 15,
OL,4,Asexually assaulted in Aberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy has been arrested and
OL,7,Fcharged after a 15-year-old girl was
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted in Aberdeen.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the Gardner
OL,11,FRoad area of the city at about 01:00 on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FPolice said an 18-year-old had been
OL,15,Farrested.
OL,17,FHe is expected to appear at Aberdeen
OL,18,FSheriff Court at a later date.
